  <data name="SettingsPage_KnotLinkCommandsDesc.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The following commands can be called via KnotLink:</value>
  </data>
  <data name="SettingsPage_KnotLinkCommandsBody.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Strict key-value protocol:
cmd=get_capabilities
cmd=PING
cmd=LIST_CONFIGS
cmd=LIST_FOLDERS;config_id=ID
cmd=LIST_BACKUPS;config_id=ID;folder=folder%20name
cmd=BACKUP;from=example.client;request_id=req-backup-001;config_id=ID;folder=folder%20name;comment=note;backup_mode=full;compression_method=zstd;compression_level=11;backup_blacklist=cache,logs;backup_whitelist=level.dat,region%2Fr.0.0.mca
cmd=BACKUP;from=example.client;request_id=req-backup-002;config_id=ID;folder=folder%20name;backup_scope=selected-regions;scope_dimensions=overworld,nether;scope_areas=0%2C0%2C511%2C511
cmd=RESTORE;from=example.client;request_id=req-restore-001;config_id=ID;folder=folder%20name;file=backup.7z;mode=clean;restore_whitelist=options.txt,playerdata
cmd=AUTO_BACKUP;from=example.client;request_id=req-auto-001;config_id=ID;folder=folder%20name;interval_minutes=10

MineRewind Plugin API v3 commands:
cmd=BACKUP;from=minebackup.mod;request_id=req-mr-backup-001;current_save=true;comment=QuickSave
cmd=LIST_BACKUPS;current_save=true
cmd=RESTORE;from=minebackup.mod;request_id=req-mr-restore-001;current_save=true
cmd=RESTORE;from=minebackup.mod;request_id=req-mr-restore-002;current_save=true;file=backup.7z;preserve_player_data=true

Keys use letters, digits, and underscores only. Values must be percent-encoded. Lists use comma-separated, individually encoded items. Requests without cmd are rejected.</value>
  </data>
